backToUsers = Back to users
backToHouseholds = Back to households
allUsers = All users
searchRecipes = Search recipes...
searchHouseholds = Search households...
searchAudit = Search actions, targets, actors, details...
recipesModeration = {$count} total, private ones included. Deleting here is for moderation; it can't be undone.
inviteUser = Invite a new user
inviteUserHelp = Creates an empty household and emails an invite link. The invitee becomes its owner and picks the name when they join.
invite = Invite
